# The lockfile is a resolver output, not source. Keeping it tracked is what
# makes `pnpm install` reproduce the same tree in CI that it does here, so it
# stays in git — but nothing good comes of reading or line-merging 12k lines of
# it. `linguist-generated` collapses it in review; `merge=binary` turns a
# conflict into "take one side, re-run install" instead of a hand merge that can
# silently produce a tree neither branch ever resolved.
pnpm-lock.yaml linguist-generated=true merge=binary
